    Join the parameter claims into the shared proximity group
    
    The shared stage now adds one member per parameter claim to the proximity
    group: the folded message committed as G_u with the group code, its sample row,
    and the record and column declaration rows built from the same claim message
    and plan reader on both sides. The prover supplies the committed folded
    message material through the norm witness and rebuilds the tree; the verifier
    builds the same members and rows from the first message. The member and row
    counts, the fold shape and the base and mask budgets stay member derived. A
    test checks that the shared claims carry the parameter sample, record and
    column rows.
    
    partial progress

